00:02:19,430 --> 00:02:21,182
I just said, you need some credentials.

56
00:02:21,857 --> 00:02:24,590
You have a.env.example file in the provided

57
00:02:24,590 --> 00:02:26,953
folder. And in there you see all the env

58
00:02:27,241 --> 00:02:30,162
vars that must be set in order for this app

59
00:02:30,162 --> 00:02:32,393
to be able to connect to that bucket and

60
00:02:32,393 --> 00:02:34,591
store data there and fetch it from there.

61
00:02:35,281 --> 00:02:36,774
And what we need and what all these

62
00:02:36,950 --> 00:02:40,015
S3-compatible stores give you is an access

63
00:02:40,015 --> 00:02:42,968
key ID, a secret access key, the bucket

64
00:02:42,968 --> 00:02:44,621
name, we already have that, it's

65
00:02:44,749 --> 00:02:47,285
bucket-course-demo, so I'll paste that in

