00:03:57,067 --> 00:03:59,860
anybody because these keys and so on give

96
00:03:59,956 --> 00:04:02,927
anybody who has them access to your bucket,

97
00:04:03,007 --> 00:04:03,729
to your data.

98
00:04:04,388 --> 00:04:06,426
So I'll copy the access key ID and store

99
00:04:06,491 --> 00:04:08,722
that as S3 access key ID,

100
00:04:09,605 --> 00:04:11,628
then copy the secret access key

101
00:04:13,121 --> 00:04:14,165
and also that

102
00:04:14,805 --> 00:04:15,598
endpoint here.

103
00:04:17,215 --> 00:04:19,738
And you must rename your env.example file to

104
00:04:20,126 --> 00:04:22,940
.env then so that you have a.env file with

105
00:04:22,972 --> 00:04:24,332
those settings. You can delete the

106
00:04:24,656 --> 00:04:26,796
.env.example file thereafter, but your.env

