109
00:04:32,763 --> 00:04:35,981
Now we can dive back into that bucket and

110
00:04:36,014 --> 00:04:37,938
see that it of course currently is empty.

111
00:04:38,666 --> 00:04:41,351
That's why this demo project I prepared also

112
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:43,962
contains a test folder with some demo files.

113
00:04:44,793 --> 00:04:47,121
And what we can do now is run bun install to

114
00:04:47,121 --> 00:04:49,337
install dependencies and then run bun run

115
00:04:49,385 --> 00:04:49,883
cli

116
00:04:51,135 --> 00:04:53,158
like this to see a list of supported

117
00:04:53,206 --> 00:04:55,117
commands. And we see, for example, there is

118
00:04:55,213 --> 00:04:57,847
a bucket command which wants a local path of

119
00:04:57,879 --> 00:05:00,303
the file we wanna back up and then a bunch

120
00:05:00,303 --> 00:05:01,379
of other commands as well.

121
00:05:02,310 --> 00:05:05,521
So here I'll run bun run cli backup and then

122
00:05:05,586 --> 00:05:07,079
let's say I wanna back up this

123
00:05:07,817 --> 00:05:10,001
long text file here in the test folder.

