00:05:43,914 --> 00:05:45,663
That downloads it and brings it back.

138
00:05:46,466 --> 00:05:46,931
Here it is.

139
00:05:47,846 --> 00:05:49,564
And then there are other commands too.

140
00:05:49,997 --> 00:05:51,827
Again, you can simply play around with them

141
00:05:51,923 --> 00:05:54,941
and test how this tool works. You can also

142
00:05:55,054 --> 00:05:57,285
back up an entire folder by running bun run

143
00:05:57,381 --> 00:05:58,071
cli

144
00:05:58,681 --> 00:06:02,116
backup and then just the folder path and it

145
00:06:02,116 --> 00:06:03,577
will then give you an error that this is a

146
